\subsection{Definitions and mathematical statement}
\paragraph{Statement recorded in the supplied source.}
For every fixed $\varepsilon >0$, is there a deterministic polynomial-bit-time algorithm for arbitrary finite rational metric k-median that opens at most k facilities and achieves approximation ratio $1+2/e+\varepsilon $?

